WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.369
-Well, you guys,
it is an exciting time.

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:07.006
In the world of marine biology,
recently scientists

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:11.444
have discovered four --
four -- new ocean species.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.246
A new species of comb jelly,

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.682
a new species of sea snail,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.051
a new tree spider crab,

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:21.621
and Earth's newest siphonophone.

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.091
To get the word out,
a fun group of performers

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.493
has been going around
to elementary schools

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.496
to teach children,
and we are so lucky --

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:32.866
so lucky
to have them here tonight.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:37.570
So please welcome
The Four New Animals.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.306
-Hey, hey, hey!
-Whoo!

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.808
-Yeah!
-Whoo! All right!

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.011
Are you ready to learn?!

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.679
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:47.947
-Whoo!

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:51.150
Well, all right.
Let's do it. Here we go.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:55.121
-[Rapping] ♪ There are four
new animals, come and see ♪

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:58.891
♪ Your new fun friends
that live under the sea ♪

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:02.829
♪ I'm Duobrachium sparksae,
a new kind of comb jelly ♪

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.866
♪ Like a clear plastic bag,
you can see through my belly ♪

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:10.836
♪ The way I move around
is like a hot-air balloon ♪

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:14.540
♪ Become a deep-sea diver
and visit me soon ♪

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.110
-This is so nice,
and it's probably a great way,

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.911
you know, for kids to learn.

00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:20.113
♪♪

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.649
-♪ I'm Apolemia,
and to scientists ♪

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.550
♪ I'm a brand-new thing ♪

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:28.588
♪ I look like a pile
of silly string ♪

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.756
♪ They say
I'm the longest animal ♪

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:32.491
♪ And I think they are right ♪

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:34.493
♪ At least that's what
your girlfriend said ♪

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:35.928
♪ To me last night ♪

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:37.029
-Uh-ha-ha!

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:38.431
-I-I don't think that's okay.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:42.201
-♪ I'm a bad new species
named Leptarma biju ♪

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:44.137
♪ And I'll sell you
crystal meth ♪

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.872
♪ The next time I see you ♪

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:48.074
♪ Light that pipe and ♪
-♪ Boom! ♪

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:50.042
